<title>UK: BOE forecasts 950 mln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 950 mln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited a round of fixed rate operations after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 950 million stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise 6.0 percent repos to March 25 and 26 and outright offers of bills maturing on or before March 26.</p>
</text>
